    "description": "The winter national map 1:1 million is a derivation of the topographical national map 1:1 million of Switzerland with detailed depictions of traffic, settlement areas, terrain, bodies of water and vegetation. Switzerland is comprehensively mapped in a winter representation. The winter national map 1:1 million is only available in a digital format (Swiss Map Raster, API, WMTS).",
